    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/cab759cdd5bb8fb23338b6d189f18dcc.avif?t=1732115468\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Echo Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This island is currently experiencing a major real estate boom in several industry sectors. Together with your partner, Peter, you must build multiple constructions in this Boreal village. Gaining experience without causing too much damage will definitely help ensure your success. Work with new clients to extend your expertise and meet new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/97f3e5f32b1a22505f9f69acebcd4970.poster.avif?t=1732115468\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/97f3e5f32b1a22505f9f69acebcd4970.webm?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/97f3e5f32b1a22505f9f69acebcd4970.mp4?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/a58f3b5449b3c3aeab20d5194dfa51b8.avif?t=1732115468\" width=800 height=427 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/fe24fa43eb82552edcaa27940ef028ba.poster.avif?t=1732115468\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/fe24fa43eb82552edcaa27940ef028ba.webm?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/fe24fa43eb82552edcaa27940ef028ba.mp4?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than  82 construction projects to carry out in the Echo Island village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island, you will be expected to build a variety of constructions with various complexity levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A point system based on your construction: the more walls you destroy, the more points you lose at the end of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock other characters to spice up your projects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control using a keyboard and mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A user-friendly, seamless gameplay for the whole family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Echo Island!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/0e65d6caeb6c933d85eabd36a9374b50.poster.avif?t=1732115468\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/0e65d6caeb6c933d85eabd36a9374b50.webm?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/0e65d6caeb6c933d85eabd36a9374b50.mp4?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/ed21a78b0c7c346638fc19ec091d2bd7.avif?t=1732115468\" width=800 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/cab759cdd5bb8fb23338b6d189f18dcc.avif?t=1732115468\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Echo Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This island is currently experiencing a major real estate boom in several industry sectors. Together with your partner, Peter, you must build multiple constructions in this Boreal village. Gaining experience without causing too much damage will definitely help ensure your success. Work with new clients to extend your expertise and meet new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/97f3e5f32b1a22505f9f69acebcd4970.poster.avif?t=1732115468\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/97f3e5f32b1a22505f9f69acebcd4970.webm?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/97f3e5f32b1a22505f9f69acebcd4970.mp4?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/a58f3b5449b3c3aeab20d5194dfa51b8.avif?t=1732115468\" width=800 height=427 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/fe24fa43eb82552edcaa27940ef028ba.poster.avif?t=1732115468\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/fe24fa43eb82552edcaa27940ef028ba.webm?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/fe24fa43eb82552edcaa27940ef028ba.mp4?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than  82 construction projects to carry out in the Echo Island village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island, you will be expected to build a variety of constructions with various complexity levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A point system based on your construction: the more walls you destroy, the more points you lose at the end of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock other characters to spice up your projects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control using a keyboard and mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A user-friendly, seamless gameplay for the whole family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Echo Island!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/0e65d6caeb6c933d85eabd36a9374b50.poster.avif?t=1732115468\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/0e65d6caeb6c933d85eabd36a9374b50.webm?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/0e65d6caeb6c933d85eabd36a9374b50.mp4?t=1732115468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113740/extras/ed21a78b0c7c346638fc19ec091d2bd7.avif?t=1732115468\" width=800 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In this construction game, you\u2019ll play as Jack, a proud contractor. Using his crane, Jack will build various structures, including houses, hotels, and bridges. Skillful crane operation is crucial for progress and achieving new objectives. But above all, be extra careful with your walls!",
